# STORY (Year 1 research + story), batch 3: G.I. Joe research for Year 1.
# Day 1 open list = John's short list (12 Nov 21:10). Nothing opens by date (John 21:20): every other topic follows
# from research; the months in the design are estimates of research time and cost. Done-at-start topics are
# for BUILD's starting research. The items, crafts, facilities and manufacture these open are BUILD's rules.
# costFunds = research money in dollars (John 21:28). Not an OXCE field: BUILD to read it in the fork.
# headOnly = progresses only while the department head is at base (NAMED_JOES_AT_BASE_v1). Fork flag.
